{{acceptance}}

## Current evidence
{{current_evidence}}

## Blockers
{{blockers}}

## Context
{{context}}

## Next action
{{next_action}}

## Finish
Run `fulcrum finish --bead {{bead}} --thread-id {{thread}} --ownership-operation {{ownership_operation}} --outcome OUTCOME --input - --json`. Use `answered` with `summary` and `evidence`, `planned` with `summary` and `plan_id`, `ready` with completed scope and acceptance in `summary`, or `blocked` with `summary`, `blocker`, `attempts`, and `required_action`.
